@startuml
[*] --> pending_approval : importEvidence
pending_approval --> pending_approval : stageEvidenceSummary
pending_approval --> approved : approveEvidenceSummary
pending_approval --> rejected : rejectEvidenceSummary
approved --> published : publishEvidenceSummary
rejected --> [*]
published --> [*]
note right of pending_approval
  승인·거절은 pending_approval에서만 허용
  게시에는 승인 기록과 summary hash 검증이 필요
  staging 자료는 worktree 밖의 session_directory에 보존
end note
@enduml
